#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`bmm150` --- BMM150 3-axis magnetometer"
msgstr ":mod:`bmm150` --- BMM150 3-osni magnetometar"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:7
msgid ""
"Driver for the Bosch BMM150 3-axis geomagnetic sensor over I2C. On "
"construction the driver soft-resets the device, switches it into normal "
"operating mode at the requested ODR, and reads the trim registers used by "
"the Bosch compensation equations to convert raw readings into calibrated "
"magnetic-field values."
msgstr ""
"Upravljački program za Bosch BMM150 3-osni geomagnetski senzor putem I2C. "
"Pri stvaranju upravljački program izvodi meki reset uređaja, prebacuje ga u "
"normalni način rada pri traženoj ODR i čita trim registre koje koriste "
"Boschove jednadžbe kompenzacije za pretvaranje sirovih očitanja u "
"kalibrirane vrijednosti magnetskog polja."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:15
msgid ""
"SPI mode is not supported by this driver; passing a non-I2C bus raises "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj upravljački program ne podržava SPI način rada; prosljeđivanje "
"sabirnice koja nije I2C izaziva ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:18
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "Primjer::"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:31
msgid "Classes"
msgstr "Klase"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:35
msgid ""
"Construct a ``BMM150`` instance, soft-reset the chip, verify its chip ID, "
"configure it for normal mode at ``magnet_odr`` Hz and read the factory trim "
"registers."
msgstr ""
"Stvara instancu ``BMM150``\\ , izvodi meki reset čipa, provjerava njegov ID,"
" konfigurira ga za normalni način rada pri ``magnet_odr`` Hz i čita "
"tvorničke trim registre."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:39
msgid "``bus``"
msgstr "``bus``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:40
msgid "A configured :py:class:`machine.I2C` bus the sensor is attached to."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurirana :py:class:`machine.I2C` sabirnica na koju je senzor "
"priključen."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:42
msgid "``cs``"
msgstr "``cs``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:43
msgid ""
"Reserved for SPI mode. Must be left as ``None``; SPI is not currently "
"implemented and supplying a non-I2C bus raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirano za SPI način rada. Mora ostati ``None``\\ ; SPI trenutno nije "
"implementiran, a navođenje sabirnice koja nije I2C izaziva ``ValueError``\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:47
msgid "``address``"
msgstr "``address``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:48
msgid "7-bit I2C address of the device. Defaults to ``0x10``."
msgstr "7-bitna I2C adresa uređaja. Zadana vrijednost je ``0x10``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:50
msgid "``magnet_odr``"
msgstr "``magnet_odr``"

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:51
msgid ""
"Magnetometer output data rate in Hz. Must be one of ``2``, ``6``, ``8``, "
"``10``, ``15``, ``20``, ``25`` or ``30``; anything else raises "
"``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
"Brzina izlaznih podataka magnetometra u Hz. Mora biti jedna od ``2``\\ , "
"``6``\\ , ``8``\\ , ``10``\\ , ``15``\\ , ``20``\\ , ``25`` ili ``30``\\ ; "
"bilo što drugo izaziva ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:57
msgid ""
"Poll the data-ready flag and return the raw signed ``(x, y, z, hall)`` "
"readings as integers, with the sub-LSB bits already shifted out. Raises "
"``OSError(\"Data not ready\")`` if no sample becomes available within ten "
"retries."
msgstr ""
"Provjerava zastavicu spremnosti podataka i vraća sirova predznačena očitanja"
" ``(x, y, z, hall)`` kao cijele brojeve, s već izbačenim pod-LSB bitovima. "
"Izaziva ``OSError(\"Data not ready\")`` ako nijedan uzorak ne postane "
"dostupan unutar deset pokušaja."

#: ../../library/bmm150.rst:64
msgid ""
"Read a fresh sample via :meth:`magnet_raw` and return the compensated "
"magnetic-field vector ``(x, y, z)``. The compensation uses the trim values "
"read at construction and matches the reference C driver supplied by Bosch."
msgstr ""
"Čita svježi uzorak putem :meth:`magnet_raw` i vraća kompenzirani vektor "
"magnetskog polja ``(x, y, z)``\\ . Kompenzacija koristi trim vrijednosti "
"pročitane pri stvaranju i podudara se s referentnim C upravljačkim programom"
" koji isporučuje Bosch."
